-- SPE5 (Killough & Kossack, SPE 16000, 1987) - fifth comparative solution project, case 1, as a fully compositional
-- E300 deck: 6-component Peng-Robinson (PR78) fluid of the SPE5 paper, WAG injection (1-year cycles after 2 years of
-- depletion). Grid, rock, saturation functions and wells as in the OPM black-oil/solvent version (opm-data/spe5,
-- ODbL); the fluid from Killough & Kossack Table 4 / Coats Engineering. Authored for ResSim Studio.

